lex in emitTest
lex invokes lexer.tokenize
lex argument source String source lend
lex argument resultRegion Region store lend
lex result tokens lexer.Tokens
lex ownedBy store
lex cleanedBy none
lex borrows none
lex catch lexError lexer.LexError
lex suppresses none

